  "summary": "At exact clean source b770b3feecb92532c6cc884ec2ea5dbb0455a1f9, private source-bound FAT directory paging passes 110 native groups, 21 selected headers and 103 independent cases with 17,601 entries and a 1,100-cluster directory. Exact scope refusal, lossless metadata/name continuation, private page digest integrity and finite resources are independently tested; existing decoders/cursor and source owners are reused. This does not qualify native held-source/worker integration, recursive destination effects, owner acceptance or full 0.1.0. Four supplemental nonzero/conflicting FAT copy cases pass against the same hashed probe and frozen fixtures.",
